% Generate pdd/frontend/components/ReauthModal.tsx.

Export named function ReauthModal with onClose: () => void.
Use the native dialog primitive, showModal on mount, and close on unmount.
Call api.getCloudConfiguration to display the configured URL and bearer-token availability.
When missing, explain PDD_CLOUD_URL and PDD_CLOUD_TOKEN or PDD_CLOUD_TOKEN_FILE, then restarting connect.
Show a readable error if configuration discovery fails.
Close through the button, Escape, and native dialog callbacks.
Use the existing surface colors and Tailwind classes.
Do not initiate authentication, display verification codes, or poll OAuth.
